%% Title: Orca Phase 1 System Context
%% Scope: Accepted intended Phase 1 architecture; implementation status is documented separately.
flowchart LR
    Owner[Owner]
    Codex[Codex Desktop]
    Provider[Semantic Provider]

    subgraph Host[Local Host Boundary]
        subgraph WSL[WSL Runtime]
            Connector[Codex Connector]
            Processor[Processor]
            Governance[Governance]
            Storage[Storage]
            Recall[Recall]
            Adapter[Retrieval Adapter]
            Runtime[(Local Runtime State)]
        end

        subgraph Vault[Configured Orca Vault]
            Canonical[(Canonical Memory)]
            Shallow[(Shallow Memory)]
            Candidates[(Candidates)]
            Profiles[(Interaction Profiles)]
            Manifests[(Run Manifests)]
        end
    end

    Codex -->|supported source records| Connector
    Connector -->|permitted redacted evidence| Processor
    Processor <-->|bounded input and untrusted proposals| Provider
    Processor --> Governance
    Governance --> Storage
    Storage --> Shallow
    Storage --> Candidates
    Storage --> Profiles
    Storage --> Manifests
    Storage --> Runtime
    Canonical --> Adapter
    Shallow --> Adapter
    Adapter --> Recall
    Recall -->|bounded authority-labelled context| Codex
    Owner -->|governed human acceptance only| Canonical
